title: Align shared workspace mutations with PM CLI and SDK 2026.9.4
description: "The hosted web service pins PM CLI 2026.8.31 while the coordinated hosted MCP dependency update targets 2026.9.4. Both services mutate the same project data. Pin the same current CLI/SDK, validate real workspace mutations and packed npm/Bun acceptance, and keep deployment coupled to the hosted MCP rollout."
