comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-04T20:12:03.751Z",codex-pm-services,"The complete release:check now passes with CLI/SDK 2026.9.4, including typecheck, tests, docstrings, production audit, npm pack, real npm and Bun packed extension acceptance, deterministic changelog and release provenance checks. The first packaging run exposed a stale manifest floor; manifest.json and README now match the dependency pin. Measured server coverage is 70.10% lines, 81.50% branches and 64.40% functions across 30 source files; these existing floors do not satisfy the requested all-source exact 100% gate. Review and coordinated hosted deployment remain pending."
